1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,257
Here is a strange one, and a favourite multiple choice question.

2
00:00:04,257 --> 00:00:06,848
An insulated box has a partition.

3
00:00:06,848 --> 00:00:09,583
On one side, an ideal gas.

4
00:00:09,583 --> 00:00:13,255
On the other side, nothing at all: a vacuum.

5
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:16,536
What happens to the temperature when we break the partition?

